<title>ITALY: Kuwait Petroleum cuts petrol price in Italy.</title>
<headline>Kuwait Petroleum cuts petrol price in Italy.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Petroleum Italia said on Monday it would cut petrol (gasoline) prices by 10 lire a litre from Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it was making the move because of falling crude prices and a &quot;favourable exchange rate between the dollar and the lira.&quot;</p>
</text>
